<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0565_T23FS0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How many Chains you got show how\nhard you is.\rMore Chains, better stuff on our\nshelves. That’s how capitalism work.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0565_T23FS0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bando Balls recruit better than Hood\nBalls. But don’t tell Kurt I said\fthat.\fHe’ll throw a Apricorn at me.</language>
	</row>
</body>
